# The gallery and the Prompt view need no key. Generate runs on OpenUI Dashboards and needs:
# THESYS_API_KEY: a key from https://console.thesys.dev/keys. It stays on the server.
#   Optional THESYS_BASE_URL points at another deployment (OpenUI Cloud is its origin),
#   for example https://api.dev.thesys.dev/v1/embed.
# Optional: OPENUI_DASHBOARD_MODEL, as provider/model. Default: anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5.
# Optional: VISITOR_SECRET signs the anonymous visitor cookie (default: derived from the key).
# `pnpm eval` can use OPENAI_API_KEY (with OPENAI_BASE_URL) instead of the Thesys key.

THESYS_API_KEY=
# THESYS_BASE_URL=
# OPENUI_DASHBOARD_MODEL=
# VISITOR_SECRET=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=
